<!--
必要なこと
 DONE ーグラウンドプレーンの指定
 DONE ーロボットの読み込み、ジョイント、アクチュエータ(torque<=0.021Nm)、センサの指定
 ー慣性モーメントの計算
 ー物理環境の調整（timestepsとか。必要？）

 ジョイント：タイヤの軸とボディ、前タイヤの軸
 アクチュエータ：前後のタイヤ回転
 センサ：回転角速度センサ、位置センサ、加速度センサ、ボディのIMUセンサ
 -->

<mujoco model="two_wheel_bike">
    <compiler angle="radian"/>
    <option integrator="RK4" timestep="0.0002" gravity="0 0 -9.81"/>
    <option cone="elliptic"/>
    <option solver="PGS"/>    <!-- 脚系のロボットより bike はPGSの方が安定 -->
    <option iterations="50"/>
<default>
        <default class="stl">
            <geom type="mesh" xyaxes="1 0 0 0 0 1"/>
        </default>
        
        <default class="visual_tire">
            <!-- <geom type="mesh" xyaxes="1 0 0 0 1 0" contype="0" conaffinity="0" group="1"/> -->
            <geom type="mesh" xyaxes="1 0 0 0 1 0" friction="0.8 0.5 0.001"/>
        </default>
        
        <default class="collision_tire">
            <geom type="cylinder" size="0.032 0.005" rgba="0 0 1 0.3"/> 
        </default>
    </default>
    <asset>
        <texture type="2d" name="groundplane" builtin="checker" mark="edge" rgb1="0.2 0.3 0.4" rgb2="0.1 0.2 0.3"
          markrgb="0.8 0.8 0.8" width="300" height="300"/>
        <material name="groundplane" texture="groundplane" texuniform="true" texrepeat="5 5" reflectance="0.2"/>
        <texture name="grid_tex" type="2d" builtin="checker" rgb1="0.9 0.3 0.4" rgb2="0.9 0.9 0.9" 
                width="512" height="512" mark="cross" markrgb="0 0 0"/>
        <material name="F_wheel_tex" texture="grid_tex" texuniform="true" texrepeat="1 1" reflectance="0.1"/>        <!-- <mesh name="bike" file="models/HBP_ver1_0.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/> -->
        <mesh name="body" file="models/body.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/>
        <mesh name="F_wheel" file="models/F_wheel.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/>
        <mesh name="R_wheel" file="models/R_wheel.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/>
        <mesh name="fork" file="models/fork.stl" scale="0.001 0.001 0.001"/>
    </asset>
    <worldbody>
        <light pos="0 0 10.5" dir="0 0 -1" directional="true"/>
        <geom name="floor" size="0 0 0.05" type="plane" material="groundplane"/>

        <!-- <body name="body" pos="0 0 0.04"> -->
        <body name="body" pos="0 0 0.033">
            <inertial pos="-0.050251 0.044412 0.017903" mass="0.2151" 
                fullinertia="1.473e-3 2.817e-3 3.852e-3 1.345e-3 1.834e-4 -1.423e-4"/>
            <geom mesh="body" class="stl" contype="0" conaffinity="0"/>
            <joint type="free" name="body_free_joint"/>
            <!-- <joint type="slide" axis="1 0 0" pos="0 0 0" name="root_x"/>
            <joint type="slide" axis="0 1 0" pos="0 0 0" name="root_y"/>
            <joint type="slide" axis="0 0 1" pos="0 0 0" name="root_z"/>
            <joint type="hinge" axis="0 1 0" pos="0 0 0" name="root_y_arg"/>
            <joint type="hinge" axis="0 0 1" pos="0 0 0" name="root_z_arg"/> -->
            <!-- <joint type="hinge" axis="1 0 0" pos="0 0 0" name="root_x_arg"/> -->
            <site name="imu_site" pos="-0.05 0 0.07" size="0.005"/>
            <body name="fork" pos="-0.105 -0.02 0.041">
                <inertial pos="0 -0.016822 0" mass="0.048253" 
                        fullinertia="1.3534e-5 5.6705e-6 1.3103e-5 0 0 0"/>
                <!-- <joint name="joint_fork" type="hinge" axis="0 0 1"/> -->
                <joint name="joint_fork" type="hinge" axis="0 0 1" limited="true" range="-1.57 1.57"/>
                <!-- <joint type="slide" axis="1 0 0" pos="0 0 0" name="root_x_fork"/>
                <joint type="slide" axis="0 1 0" pos="0 0 0" name="root_y_fork"/> -->
                <geom mesh="fork" class="stl" contype="0" conaffinity="0"/>
                <body name="F_wheel" pos="0 -0.005 -0.040">
                    <inertial pos="0 0.005508 0" mass="0.243435" 
                        fullinertia="5.2849e-5 1.0120e-4 5.2849e-5 0 0 0"/>
                    <joint name="joint_F_wheel" type="hinge" axis="0 1 0" damping="0.00005"/>
                    <geom mesh="F_wheel" class="visual_tire" material="F_wheel_tex"/>
                    <!-- <geom pos="0 0.0045 0" name="col_F_wheel" class="collision_tire" zaxis="0 1 0" friction="0.0 0.0 0.001"/> -->
                    <geom type="box" size="0.005 0.01 0.002" pos="0.02 0 0" rgba="1 0 0 1"/>
                </body>
            </body>
            <body name="R_wheel" pos="0 -0.027 0">
                <inertial pos="0 0.002777 0" mass="0.148797" 
                    fullinertia="4.5897e-5 8.4246e-5 4.5897e-5 0 0 0"/>
                <joint name="joint_R_wheel" type="hinge" axis="0 1 0" damping="0.00005"/>
                <geom mesh="R_wheel" class="visual_tire" material="F_wheel_tex"/>
                <!-- <geom name="col_R_wheel" class="collision_tire" zaxis="0 1 0" friction="0.5 0.1 0.001"/> -->
                <geom type="box" size="0.005 0.005 0.002" pos="0.02 -0.002 0" rgba="1 0 0 1"/>
            </body>
        </body>              
    </worldbody>
    <actuator>
        <position name="fork" joint="joint_fork"/>
        <motor joint="joint_F_wheel" ctrlrange="-10 10"/>
        <motor joint="joint_R_wheel" ctrlrange="-10 10"/>
    </actuator>
    <sensor>
        <!-- <jointpos name="F_wheel_pos" joint="F_wheel_joint"/> -->
        <jointpos name="F_wheel_pos" joint="joint_fork" noise="0.0001"/>
        <jointvel name="F_wheel_vel" joint="joint_fork" noise="0.001"/>
        <jointpos name="R_wheel_pos" joint="joint_R_wheel" noise="0.0001"/>
        <jointvel name="R_wheel_vel" joint="joint_R_wheel" noise="0.001"/>
        <accelerometer name="imu" site="imu_site"/>
        <framequat name="imu_quat" objtype="site" objname="imu_site" noise="0.01"/>
        <gyro name="imu_gyro" site="imu_site" noise="0.005"/>
    </sensor>
</mujoco>
